# Origin of the staff app this build links to (Acceder, plan CTAs -> /registro).
# Bare host or full origin both work. Leave unset to derive it from the Vercel
# deployment context: canonical production -> app.wasiy.co, anything else
# (stage project, previews, `vercel dev`) -> app.stage.wasiy.co.
# Set it per environment in the Vercel dashboard to override.
# APP_URL=app.stage.wasiy.co
